# Consign to Memory (the one Modern gauntlet card card-smoke cannot judge on
# its fixed board): TargetType$ Spell.Colorless,Triggered lets it counter a
# colorless spell (CounterEffect, TargetRestrictions). The human casts
# Ornithopter, the AI counters it without replicating.
startturn human
advance 3
castspell human 1
tapformana ai 30 U
# Replicate asks how many times; none.
queue numberchoice 0
queue targets 1
castspell ai 32
resolvestack
